#: ../../source/docs/initial-setup.rst:5 730f52f187ba47eca754afd9de125939
msgid "First Time Setup"
msgstr "首次配置"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-setup.rst:7 faf666460292475f84aff207e2d13350
msgid ""
"First-time setup of the autopilot includes downloading and installing a "
"Ground Control Station (GCS), mounting the autopilot to the frame, "
"connecting it to the receiver, power and motors, and then performing initial"
" configuration and calibration."
msgstr "飞控的首次配置包括：下载并安装地面站（GCS）软件、将飞控安装到机架上、连接接收机/电源/电机，然后完成初始配置与校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/initial-setup.rst:14 9d2f51d8d63248aa934b8cfc548552e6
msgid ""
"This section assumes that you've already :ref:`chosen and built a blimp "
"<building-a-blimp>`."
msgstr "本章节假定你已经 :ref:`选好并搭建好一个飞艇 <building-a-blimp>`。"

